		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">4-channel electronic circuit breaker, 24 V DC, 4 x 1-4 A</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">one status LED, one push button and one current selector per channel; group alarm output; no separate 0 V output terminal per channel (assumed)</elementInformation>
